Package: pamflow
Title: End-to-End Passive Acoustic Monitoring Workflow
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("RJ", "Pradeeshwar", email = "pradeeshwarrj@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Standardising passive acoustic recordings, running BirdNET acoustic
    scanning, validating detections, calculating soundscape diversity indices,
    and preparing occupancy-ready detection histories and reports.
